Shock Cavalry represents the Deikhan mastery of devastating mounted charge
tactics. Where ordinary riders simply attack from horseback, a Deikhan
trained in shock cavalry transforms mount and rider into a thundering force
that crashes through enemy lines.

This skill enhances the damage and effectiveness of mounted charges. The
Deikhan learns to guide their mount at the perfect angle, time their strike
for maximum impact, and maintain control even as they barrel through foes.

The effects of Shock Cavalry are automatic when executing charge attacks
while mounted. Higher learning in this skill produces more devastating
charges that can scatter formations and demoralize enemies.

Class: Deikhan
Discipline: Mounted Combat

